# Chaos Shard — English

tile.chaosshard.chaos_stone.name=Chaosite
tile.chaosshard.chaos_crust.name=Antechamber Crust

chaosshard.antechamber.first_arrival=Grimoire: Oh, you're awake. Welcome to the Antechamber, Shard. Look around — just stay away from the edge. The void out there is hungry.
chaosshard.antechamber.reassembled=Grimoire: Piecing you back together again. The Lord is patient. I am slightly less so.

chaosshard.thread.levelup.1=Grimoire: Feel that? The Thread is taut (level %s). The Lord heard you. So did the stars — check your perk tree.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.2=Grimoire: The Thread grows stronger (level %s). The Lord has noticed you. Don't get cocky, but a little pride is allowed.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.3=Grimoire: The Thread holds steady (level %s). More is open to you than I expected. I like being wrong this way.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.4=Grimoire: The Thread sings (level %s). The Lord is pleased — rarer than you think. Your star perks burn brighter.
chaosshard.thread.levelup.5=Grimoire: The Thread is at full strength (level %s). You are Lord Death's voice and hand now. The whole star tree is yours. Don't fail him.
chaosshard.hud.thread=Thread %s · %s/%s
chaosshard.hud.thread.max=Thread %s · max

