astralsorcery.constellation.chaos.info=The Lord's Mark
astralsorcery.constellation.chaos.effect=An eight-pointed star visible in the sky of any world. Not a constellation of these heavens, but a mark Lord Death leaves wherever his Shards arrive.
astralsorcery.constellation.chaos.enchantments=The properties of this light are not yet known.
astralsorcery.constellation.chaos.ritual=The Chaos ritual is not yet revealed. The Grimoire promises "in due time".
astralsorcery.constellation.chaos.capeeffect=A mantle attuned to Chaos stays silent for now.
knowledge.astralsorcery.fragment.constellation.chaos.showup.name=The Lord's Mark
knowledge.astralsorcery.fragment.constellation.chaos.showup.bookmark=Appearance
knowledge.astralsorcery.fragment.constellation.chaos.showup.description=The Chaos constellation shows every night, in any world that has a sky. Above the Antechamber it burns together with every other constellation at once.

